[00:00.00] 作词 : Morgan Wallen/Ryan Vojtesak/Ashley Gorley/Rocky Block/Blake Pendergrass/John Byron
[00:00.00][by:土豆头_先生]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Morgan Wallen/Ryan Vojtesak/Ashley Gorley/Rocky Block/Blake Pendergrass/John Byron
[00:08.61]Wouldn't trade this holler for a stone cold million dollars
[00:08.61]我才不拿这片山沟沟去换什么一百万呢 
[00:11.84]My green all comes blue collar and I'm all good with that
[00:11.84]我的钱都是靠自己辛苦干出来的，我觉得这就很好
[00:15.90]This world's been changin' but these folks 'round here, they ain't been
[00:15.90]这世道在变可这儿的人啊，还是老样子  
[00:19.01]They all still windshield wavin' when they slow rollin' past
[00:19.01]大家开车慢慢过的时候车窗里人还会挥个手打个招呼  
[00:22.86]We could live a little higher on the hog
[00:22.86]咱要是想活得再阔绰点也行  
[00:26.61]But I don't think that we'd be no better off
[00:26.61]可我觉得那也未必能让我更快乐  
[00:30.36]Not everybody got that spot out in the forty
[00:30.36]不是谁都有块自己的地儿  
[00:33.88]Some ten point buck they shot hangin' like a velvet trophy
[00:33.88]挂着自己打下来的十点大鹿角当个软绒绒的奖杯  
[00:37.53]Fridays in parkin' lots, outside of somewhere holy
[00:37.53]礼拜五就在教堂外面的停车场聚一聚  
[00:41.13]Not everybody likes this kinda life but we do, don't we?
[00:41.13]不是谁都喜欢这种日子，但我们喜欢，不是吗？  
[00:45.12]Still workin' hard like my daddy told me
[00:45.12]还是像我爸说的那样踏实干活  
[00:47.87]Still keep it low key, still ridin' high behind them low beams
[00:47.87]低调做人，开着车灯也只亮着近光灯  
[00:51.95]If you don't know about this nowhere, you don't know me
[00:51.95]你要是不懂这种啥也没有的地方，就不算认识我  
[00:55.57]Not everybody thinks we got it made but we do, don't we?
[00:55.57]不是谁都觉得我们这日子过得好 可我们觉得挺好，不是吗？  
[01:06.39]It might be simple but these two lanes, they're my temple
[01:06.39]也许日子简单可这两条小路就是我的圣地  
[01:09.51]And that river rollin' gentle wash my worries away
[01:09.51]那条慢慢流淌的小河，能把我心头的烦恼都带走  
[01:13.58]I used to hate it but I travelled lots of pavement
[01:13.58]以前我也嫌弃过这地方 可走了那么多路  
[01:16.70]And there ain't no better places at the end of the day
[01:16.70]最后发现哪儿都比不上这儿  
[01:20.11]So I pass the plate and thank the Lord He put me here
[01:20.11]所以我递上捐款盘感激上帝让我留在这  
[01:24.43]And pray that towns like mine don't ever disappear
[01:24.43]也祈祷像我们这的小镇千万别消失不见  
